{"seq":1,"slug":"cognitive-accessibility","title":"认知无障碍工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/advanced/cognitive-accessibility","wordCount":1165,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"认知无障碍工程实践\">认知无障碍工程实践</h1><p>认知障碍影响全球超过 10 亿人——涵盖注意力缺陷（ADHD）、阅读障碍（Dyslexia）、自闭谱系（ASD）、创伤性脑损伤、年龄相关认知下降等。WCAG 2.2 的多项新准则直接面向此群体（一致性帮助 3.2.6、冗余输入 3.3.7、无障碍认证 3.3.8/3.3.9），而即将到来的 WCAG 3.0 计划将认知可访问性提升到与感知/操作同等地位。但与视觉/运动无障碍不同，认知无障碍很少能通过自动化工具检测——它要求工程师理解用户的认知负荷模型，并在设计和实现中主动降低复杂度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>认知无障碍的工程目标可以归纳为四个降低：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[认知无障碍四降低] --&gt; B[降低记忆负荷]&#10;    A --&gt; C[降低注意力需求]&#10;    A --&gt; D[降低决策复杂度]&#10;    A --&gt; E[降低学习成本]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[自动补全/记住输入]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[冗余输入避免]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[持久化用户偏好]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[一致的布局]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[减少干扰/通知]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[清晰的视觉层级]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[渐进式披露]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[合理默认值]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[可撤销操作]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[无认知测试认证]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[熟悉的交互模式]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[即时反馈]\">graph TD\n    A[认知无障碍四降低] --&gt; B[降低记忆负荷]\n    A --&gt; C[降低注意力需求]\n    A --&gt; D[降低决策复杂度]\n    A --&gt; E[降低学习成本]\n    B --&gt; B1[自动补全/记住输入]\n    B --&gt; B2[冗余输入避免]\n    B --&gt; B3[持久化用户偏好]\n    C --&gt; C1[一致的布局]\n    C --&gt; C2[减少干扰/通知]\n    C --&gt; C3[清晰的视觉层级]\n    D --&gt; D1[渐进式披露]\n    D --&gt; D2[合理默认值]\n    D --&gt; D3[可撤销操作]\n    E --&gt; E1[无认知测试认证]\n    E --&gt; E2[熟悉的交互模式]\n    E --&gt; E3[即时反馈]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>WCAG 2.2 认知相关准则</th>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>核心要求</th>\n<th>工程实现方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>3.2.6 Consistent Help</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>帮助机制跨页位置一致</td>\n<td>固定位置的帮助入口组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.3.7 Redundant Entry</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>不重复要求已提供信息</td>\n<td>表单预填 + 会话持久化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.3.8 Accessible Auth (Min)</td>\n<td>AA</td>\n<td>认证不依赖认知测试</td>\n<td>支持粘贴/自动填充 + Passkey</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.3.9 Accessible Auth (Enh)</td>\n<td>AAA</td>\n<td>连对象识别也不允许</td>\n<td>纯 Passkey/Magic Link</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.2.6 Timeouts</td>\n<td>AAA</td>\n<td>告知用户数据将因超时丢失</td>\n<td>超时前警告 + 延时选项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.3.4 Error Prevention</td>\n<td>AA</td>\n<td>可逆/可检查/可确认</td>\n<td>确认步骤 + 撤销机制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"无障碍认证的工程实现\">无障碍认证的工程实现</h2><p>WCAG 3.3.8 要求认证流程不得依赖认知功能测试——这意味着传统的密码记忆、验证码解谜不满足 AA 合规（除非提供替代）：</p>\n<p><strong>合规方案层级：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Passkey / WebAuthn（最佳）：</strong> 生物识别或设备 PIN，零认知负荷</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const credential = await navigator.credentials.get({&#10;  publicKey: {&#10;    challenge: serverChallenge,&#10;    allowCredentials: registeredCredentials,&#10;    userVerification: &#39;preferred&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> credential</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.credentials.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  publicKey: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    challenge: serverChallenge,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    allowCredentials: registeredCredentials,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    userVerification: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'preferred'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><ol start=\"2\">\n<li><strong>Magic Link / OTP 自动填充：</strong> 邮件/短信验证码，允许粘贴和浏览器自动填充</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 允许浏览器自动填充 OTP --&gt;&#10;&lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; inputmode=&quot;numeric&quot; autocomplete=&quot;one-time-code&quot; aria-label=&quot;验证码&quot; /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 允许浏览器自动填充 OTP --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inputmode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"numeric\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"one-time-code\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"验证码\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span></code></pre></div><ol start=\"3\">\n<li><p><strong>OAuth / SSO：</strong> 委托给身份提供商，减少用户需要管理的凭证</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>密码 + 允许粘贴（最低合规）：</strong> 不阻止密码粘贴和密码管理器自动填充</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 错误：阻止粘贴违反 3.3.8 --&gt;&#10;&lt;input type=&quot;password&quot; onpaste=&quot;return false&quot; /&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 正确：允许粘贴和密码管理器 --&gt;&#10;&lt;input type=&quot;password&quot; autocomplete=&quot;current-password&quot; /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 错误：阻止粘贴违反 3.3.8 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"password\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onpaste</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 正确：允许粘贴和密码管理器 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"password\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> autocomplete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"current-password\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>验证码替代方案：</strong> reCAPTCHA v3（无可见挑战，后台风险评分）、hCaptcha accessibility cookie、Cloudflare Turnstile（无交互验证）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冗余输入避免的实现\">冗余输入避免的实现</h2><p>WCAG 3.3.7 要求同一流程中用户已提供的信息不得要求重复输入。工程实现涉及会话状态管理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CheckoutState {&#10;  shippingAddress: Address;&#10;  billingAddress: Address;&#10;  billingMatchesShipping: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function BillingForm({ checkoutState }: { checkoutState: CheckoutState }) {&#10;  if (checkoutState.billingMatchesShipping) {&#10;    return (&#10;      &lt;fieldset&gt;&#10;        &lt;legend&gt;账单地址&lt;/legend&gt;&#10;        &lt;label&gt;&#10;          &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; checked&#10;                 onChange={() =&gt; setBillingMatchesShipping(false)} /&gt;&#10;          与收货地址相同&#10;        &lt;/label&gt;&#10;        {/* 显示已填地址供确认，不要求重新输入 */}&#10;        &lt;address aria-label=&quot;账单地址（同收货地址）&quot;&gt;&#10;          {formatAddress(checkoutState.shippingAddress)}&#10;        &lt;/address&gt;&#10;      &lt;/fieldset&gt;&#10;    );&#10;  }&#10;  // 展开完整账单地址表单...&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CheckoutState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  shippingAddress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Address</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  billingAddress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Address</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  billingMatchesShipping</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BillingForm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">checkoutState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">checkoutState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CheckoutState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (checkoutState.billingMatchesShipping) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fieldset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">legend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>账单地址</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">legend</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"checkbox\"</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> checked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                 onChange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{() => </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setBillingMatchesShipping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">          与收货地址相同</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 显示已填地址供确认，不要求重新输入 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">address aria</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"账单地址（同收货地址）\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          {</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">formatAddress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">checkoutState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">shippingAddress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">address</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fieldset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 展开完整账单地址表单...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>技术策略：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>多步表单使用 <code>sessionStorage</code> 或状态管理保持已填数据</li>\n<li>跨页面导航时通过 URL 参数或后端 session 传递</li>\n<li>提供「与 XX 相同」的快捷选项</li>\n<li>浏览器 <code>autocomplete</code> 属性正确配置加速填充</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"一致性帮助-consistent-help\">一致性帮助（Consistent Help）</h2><p>WCAG 3.2.6 要求帮助机制在多个页面间保持相对位置一致。工程上需要一个全局帮助组件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 每个页面的 footer 之前固定放置帮助组件 --&gt;&#10;&lt;aside aria-label=&quot;获取帮助&quot; class=&quot;consistent-help&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;a href=&quot;/contact&quot;&gt;联系客服&lt;/a&gt;&#10;  &lt;a href=&quot;/faq&quot;&gt;常见问题&lt;/a&gt;&#10;  &lt;button aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot;&gt;在线聊天&lt;/button&gt;&#10;&lt;/aside&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 每个页面的 footer 之前固定放置帮助组件 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">aside</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> aria-label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"获取帮助\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"consistent-help\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">a</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/contact\"</span><span 