n class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>返回修改&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dialog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>工程原则：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>错误消息必须指明问题 + 给出修复方式（不是「输入无效」而是「请输入有效邮箱格式，例如 <a href=\"mailto:name@example.com\">name@example.com</a>」）</li>\n<li>提交后焦点移动到错误摘要或第一个错误字段</li>\n<li>提供撤销/修改的路径（WCAG 3.3.4 Error Prevention）</li>\n<li>不因超时静默丢失用户数据——超时前给出警告和延时选项</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"渐进式披露降低认知负荷\">渐进式披露降低认知负荷</h2><p>一次展示过多信息会压垮认知障碍用户。渐进式披露将信息按需展示：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function SettingsPanel() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      {/* 第一层：最常用设置直接可见 */}&#10;      &lt;section aria-label=&quot;基本设置&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;NotificationToggle /&gt;&#10;        &lt;LanguageSelect /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/section&gt;&#10;&#10;      {/* 第二层：Disclosure 模式按需展开 */}&#10;      &lt;details&gt;&#10;        &lt;summary&gt;高级设置&lt;/summary&gt;&#10;        &lt;section aria-label=&quot;高级设置&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;APIKeyConfig /&gt;&#10;          &lt;WebhookConfig /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/section&gt;&#10;      &lt;/details&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SettingsPanel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 第一层：最常用设置直接可见 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">section aria</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"基本设置\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">NotificationToggle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">LanguageSelect </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">section</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 第二层：Disclosure 模式按需展开 */</span><span style=